    "question_en": "Given pyramid S.ABCD with parallelogram base ABCD and center O. Let M, N, P, and Q be the midpoints of AD, BC, SC, and SD, respectively. A plane (\\alpha) passes through O and is parallel to plane (SAB). Its lines of intersection with planes (SBC) and (SAD), respectively, are:",
