    "question_en": "Given pyramid S.ABCD whose base ABCD is a trapezoid with larger base AB. Let M be the midpoint of CD. A plane (\\alpha) through M is parallel to SA and BC. The cross-section of the pyramid by (\\alpha) is a:",
