    "question_en": "In Oxyz space, plane $(P):ax+by+cz+d=0$, with $c<0$, passes through A(0,1,0) and B(1,0,0) and makes a $60^\\circ$ angle with the coordinate plane (Oyz). Find $a+b+c$.",
