    "question_en": "In Oxyz space, let A(2,0,1), $\\vec u=(1,-3,2)$, and $\\vec v=(-1,-1,2)$. Plane $(Q)$ passes through A and has $\\vec u,\\vec v$ as direction vectors. Its equation is $ax+by+cz-3=0$. Find $a+b+c$.",
    "options": [],
    "solution_vi": "Vectơ pháp tuyến của mặt phẳng ( Q ) là n(Q ) = [b, a ] = ( 4;4;4 ).\nPhương trình mặt phẳng ( Q ) là: 4 ( x − 2 ) + 4 ( y − 0 ) + 4 ( z − 1) = 0 ⇔ 4 x − 8 + 4 y + 4 z − 4 = 0\n⇔ 4 x + 4 y + 4 z − 12 = 0 ⇔ x + y + z − 3 = 0. Suy ra a = b = c = 1 nên a + b + c = 3.",
    "solution_en": "",
